= University of Wisconsin School of Medicine and Public Health - Prompt 05

#section_label("Prompt metadata")
- Title: COVID Impact
- Limit: 250 words
- Cycle used in this repo: 2024 archive on Admit.org
- Source: https://med.admit.org/secondary-essays/university-of-wisconsin-school-of-medicine-and-public-health
- Local notes file: prompt-05.local.md

#section_label("Prompt text")
In a paragraph, please share how COVID-19 impacted your application in any of the following domains: academic, volunteer, research, work, personal life.

